1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,650
A robot can imitate a hand trajectory while missing the contact that actually makes the task work.
机器人能模仿手轨迹，却错过真正起作用的接触。

2
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:09,950
TactiDex records human touch alongside motion,
TactiDex同步采集触觉与运动，

3
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:13,310
and TactiSkill uses that information to guide transfer.
TactiSkill用这些信息指导迁移。

4
00:00:13,875 --> 00:00:19,235
The dataset aligns whole-hand tactile measurements with hand motion and object states.
数据集对齐全手触觉、手部运动与物体状态。

5
00:00:19,775 --> 00:00:26,475
Post-optimization and sensor-to-simulation mapping turn these recordings into physically aligned references for training.
后优化和传感器到仿真的映射生成物理对齐参考。

6
00:00:27,062 --> 00:00:33,682
The transfer framework trains a residual tracking policy with three complementary tactile reward components.
迁移框架用三种互补触觉奖励训练残差跟踪策略。

7
00:00:34,202 --> 00:00:39,482
The first encourages the robot to establish contact where the human demonstration indicates it matters.
第一项引导机器人在示范的重要区域建立接触。

8
00:00:40,103 --> 00:00:46,903
A human-like alignment term encourages the transferred interaction to follow the recorded contact and force pattern.
类人对齐项使迁移交互遵循记录的接触和力模式。

9
00:00:47,443 --> 00:00:52,263
Matching visible joint motion alone would leave this part of the physical behavior unconstrained.
只匹配可见关节运动，无法约束这部分物理行为。

10
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:58,699
A contact-constraint term limits problematic forces while the policy adjusts the retargeted action.
接触约束项限制不合理力，策略则调整重定向动作。

11
00:00:59,119 --> 00:01:05,099
The intended result is a motion that preserves useful interaction, rather than merely resembling a pose sequence.
目标是保留有效交互，而不只是姿态序列相似。

12
00:01:05,852 --> 00:01:11,272
The main comparison uses seventy-three reference sequences evaluated in simulation.
主要比较使用73条参考序列，在仿真中评测。

13
00:01:11,912 --> 00:01:18,452
The tactile-fidelity criterion measures whether the transferred contact matches the reference under its specified rules.
触觉保真判据衡量迁移接触是否满足参考匹配规则。

14
00:01:19,181 --> 00:01:27,041
Tactile-fidelity success reaches sixty-four point six four percent, versus thirty-nine point three five for kinematic transfer.
触觉保真64.64%，运动学迁移为39.35%。

15
00:01:27,581 --> 00:01:31,886
Contact F-one rises from point five five six nine to point seven three eight four.
Contact F1由0.5569升到0.7384。

16
00:01:32,336 --> 00:01:38,656
The appendix states that physical deployment does not feed tactile signals back into the policy online.
附录明确：真机执行不把触觉在线反馈给策略。

17
00:01:39,356 --> 00:01:46,696
The robot performs open-loop execution, so these demonstrations cannot establish autonomous tactile-feedback reliability.
真机采用开环执行，不能证明自主触觉反馈可靠性。

18
00:01:47,522 --> 00:01:50,802
TactiDex contributes measured human interaction;
TactiDex提供人类交互测量，

19
00:01:51,322 --> 00:01:55,102
TactiSkill demonstrates how that contact can shape a transfer objective.
TactiSkill展示接触如何塑造迁移目标。

20
00:01:55,402 --> 00:02:01,462
Keep simulation fidelity, kinematic matching, and complete real-world task success as separate questions.
仿真保真、运动匹配、真机完整成功应分别评价。
